# Large lab datasets published as GitHub Release assets instead of committed.
# Fetched once at Codespace creation by scripts/fetch-lab-data.mjs; see
# scripts/lab-data-manifest.json for sizes, checksums and how to rebuild each
# one from its original public source. Git LFS was rejected deliberately: its
# free tier meters 1 GB/month of bandwidth, which a class exhausts in about six
# clones, and clones then fail rather than slow down.
notebooks/pneumonia-screening/data/pneumoniamnist_128.npz
